    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">bundagh as cleayshagh</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">soilshagh cummal boghtey, ayns soilshaghyn, cur chluichyn chlappeagh bundagh as ronsaghey cre vud mess a va jannoo shoh.ocht</string>
