    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">curragh bluetooth</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">cha nel android gen fys eh app ny skeeal bluetooth goll kemmag, as cre ta fir-dy-chumey eh, mannagh vel bluetooth curragh ayn. shoh crau ta ylih coontey paart dy chluichyn chlappeagh veih stereo kaart, as crau ta fys ayn paart veih ynrick.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">lesh eh: ta paart dy chooilley vad kiart currit veih yn staid ayn jannoo, cha vel rish gimragh as cha vel veme dy ghoaill da vraa.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">gyn eh: cha nel chluichyn chlappeagh bluetooth currit ga-ta. ta’n sneck elley jeu app foast soilagh, as foddee ayd eh cur kerrishyn er dooie ayns soilshaghyn app android.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">skeealyn</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">ta cummal boghtey soilshagh cur ergane keeshagh ansoor, as ta android eginney dy gheddyn skeeal yn app soilagh y yannoo.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">lesh eh: ta’n skeeal goaill shoh kiart currit agh, va shen yn scoor row dy ennaghtyn jeh soilshagh cummal boghtey ga-ta.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">gyn eh: ta cummal boghtey soilshagh foast roshtey as foast kiart currit. cha nel android jannoo ’noidagh ’sy skeeal.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">cur rish countaghey dy vad jees goll gyn smooinaghey er shoh</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">ta android cur sneck da app t’er nagh vel fossit er son kiare meeghyn as goaill ny kiedyn rish, va shen lhag ylih ayns shen coyrt dy cherney kumor dty vel fossit er reesht. ve goll gyn smooinaghey ta cronney yere app er son, shen-y-fa ta eh rial dy chur eh shoh shoh magh agh.</string>
